# On-call

Following the Claude Code team's practice: what review doesn't catch is covered by **finding it fast and stopping it fast**. Most changes merge after only one person has looked at them, so someone has to keep watching after the merge.

## Rotation

The on-call person changes every Monday, in table order from top to bottom, then starts over. At handover, say so in the team channel and hand over anything left open from the previous week.

